dians Aura</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Champion\" title=\"Fallen Champion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Portrait_Fallen_Champion.png/30px-Portrait_Fallen_Champion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Portrait_Fallen_Champion.png/45px-Portrait_Fallen_Champion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Portrait_Fallen_Champion.png/60px-Portrait_Fallen_Champion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fallen Champion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Portrait_Fallen_Champion.png/30px-Portrait_Fallen_Champion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Portrait_Fallen_Champion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Champion\" title=\"Fallen Champion\">Fallen Champion</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Damages enemies within 3 m (10 ft) every turn, and halves their <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">movement speed</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715154438\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3584/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 54497/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18126/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.030/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1260535/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time repo